note Pyamff 0.1.0-beta commit 240f51d0, unmodified. The archived C2H4 trajectory, 50 random_uniform[-1, 1) starts, hidden layers 10 7, tanh, NoScaler, force coefficient 0, LBFGS, loss grad tol 0.02, epoch cap 10000. This release names the sum-of-squares loss SSE, and a fresh start sets init_model_parameters because the default opens a saved parameter file. One harness call is one logged training epoch. Mean epoch 2527.88 against the archive 2157.14. The gap is a finding.
